flowchart LR
 Human --> CLI[RCC local CLI]
 CLI --> G[Git read-only identity/status]
 CLI --> Decision[Context plan]
 Decision --> Native[Native agent tools]
 Decision --> AIF[Optional AIF executable]
 AIF --> Evidence[Verifiable source package]
 CLI --> Patch[Patch-plan / Git check]
 Patch --> Approval{Human approval + unchanged preimage}
 Approval -->|deny| Stop[Stop without mutation]
 Approval -->|approve| Apply[git apply to working tree]
 Apply --> Receipt[Before/after receipt; tests not run]
